Subject: Some questions regarding the info in the User Guide
Message-ID: <pGflLSw2Urw.pZxuVQ7GAgAJ@irace-package.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/irace-package/c/pGflLSw2Urw/m/pZxuVQ7GAgAJ>
